<title>USA: Yonkers Financial Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Yonkers Financial Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>YONKERS, N.Y. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended December 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		     $N/A</p>
<p> Net			    667			391</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Per share figures for Q1 1995 do not apply because the company converted to stock form on April 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $262.1 million from $259.5 million at September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 provision for loan losses were $75,000 versus $100,000 for Q1 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
